 61	     * @param newAnimals A list to return newly born animals.
 62	     * @param atDayTime true if current step is daytime false otherwise.
 63	     * @param oxygenLevel The inital level of dissolved oxygen in the water.
 64	     * @param disease The disease may happened during simulation.
